    "scenesThatPass": [
      "INGRID: Hi Charlotte.\nCHARLOTTE: Ingrid...?\nINGRID: Congratulations.\nINGRID: THANKS FOR INVITING ME, CUNT!",
      "INGRID: Whoa.\nTAYLOR: “Live in the sunshine, swim in the sea, drink the wild air.” Ralph Waldo Emerson.\nTAYLOR: My muse. Hashtag Rothko The Dog.\nTAYLOR: There is science, logic and reason. And then there is... California.",
      "TAYLOR: I Am Grateful for this vegan enchilada with raw cacao mole sauce. Praying hands emoji.\nINGRID: Damn, girl! That looks yummy. What’s your email address?\nINGRID: I am SUCH a foodie. Should we be best friends?\nINGRID: OMG! Where is this place??",
      "TAYLOR: ... I love the feel of ink on paper. It’s so tactile.\nINGRID: Okay. Relax. Just be cool. Hey! How are you?! I’m a huge fan! Fuck... Oh my god! Hi! It’s me! Ingrid! No! Shut up! Just be yourself...",
      "INGRID: Mmmm. This looks so bread.\nTAYLOR: Sorry?\nINGRID: I mean good. This bread looks so good. Sounds like somebody didn’t have their coffee this morning!\nINGRID: I think I’ll buy this."
    ]
  },
